        },
        "backstory": {
          "v": "Percy considers the HyperNorm timetable a private understanding between himself and reality. The Men in Black appreciate his complaints; Hunky and Dory help enlarge them. A contradictory card asked whether the delay had inconvenienced anyone else. He began a forceful reply and noticed the resident beside him carrying a heavier bag. Percy remains offended. He has, however, offered to carry it while explaining why.",
