        "backstory": {
          "v": "Bert refuses to move on the HyperNorm landing until someone explains why he should. The Men in Black admire firmness when it faces the right direction; Hunky and Dory provide directions. A dissonant card suggested that changing position need not mean losing. He is testing this cautiously. Yesterday he moved aside for a tired neighbour and described it as a strategic improvement.",
